<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:13:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>股市调整？不管怎样——华尔街看好 2027 年，一位首席投资官预计标普 500 指数将飙升 45% 至 10,000 点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/stock-market-correction-sp500-2027-forecasts-ai-boom-fed-rate-hikes/</link><description>“我们预计股市牛市将持续。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2306070241-e1795300265831.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:02:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/stock-market-correction-sp500-2027-forecasts-ai-boom-fed-rate-hikes/</guid></item><item><title>分析师警告说，人工智能的崩溃对中国经济构成越来越大的威胁，对习近平主席来说也是“真正的危险时刻”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/ai-bust-china-economy-xi-jinping-property-crash-stock-market/</link><description>“为了保持人工智能资金的流动，习近平需要一个活跃的股市。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305267967-e1795290326772.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:45:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/ai-bust-china-economy-xi-jinping-property-crash-stock-market/</guid></item><item><title>充满美国芯片的数据中心正在为中国人工智能模型服务——破坏特朗普的科技野心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/data-centers-us-chips-serve-chinese-models/</link><description>确保美国在芯片和云服务方面优势的基础设施也为中国人工智能模型提供了传播平台。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304686928-e1795179730515.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/data-centers-us-chips-serve-chinese-models/</guid></item><item><title>就连联邦应急管理局官员也担心一连串的停电，并提取了额外的现金——“这太可怕了，而且没有领导力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/fema-network-outages-extra-cash-emergency-supplies-cyberattacks/</link><description>“如此多的行业如此紧密地联系在一起，以前从未发生过如此规模的事情。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2184791773-e1795283675217.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:50:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/fema-network-outages-extra-cash-emergency-supplies-cyberattacks/</guid></item><item><title>“这似乎是一种极端的隐私侵犯行为。”报告称，来自 Muse AI 代理的令人惊讶的消息让 Meta 自己的员工感到不安</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/meta-employees-muse-ai-agent-extreme-privacy-violation-encrypted-signal-messages/</link><description>在一个例子中，一位 Meta 工作人员报告说，Muse 在她的个人手机上向她发送了一条提醒，要求她回复她姐姐在加密消息服务 Signal 上发来的消息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2296209094-e1795275033380.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:28:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/meta-employees-muse-ai-agent-extreme-privacy-violation-encrypted-signal-messages/</guid></item><item><title>成为“姐妹”的 120,500 美元成本：SNL 短片揭示了美国的护理危机</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/snl-sister-sketch-caregiving-gender-gap-women/</link><description>密歇根大学的研究人员表示，女性预计要照顾年长亲戚的时间从 2011 年的 6 年增加到 7 年。男性的照顾年限为 4 年。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2293942570-e1795274678914.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:27:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/snl-sister-sketch-caregiving-gender-gap-women/</guid></item><item><title>“非凡而极端的后盾”：地球正义组织警告陆军不要绕过暂停的爱荷华州许可证</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/court-pauses-army-iowa-lead-azide-detonation-permit/</link><description>第八巡回法院暂停了美国环保署对陆军周一引爆近五吨叠氮化铅的许可。司法部表示，环保署的规定可能会让陆军采取行动。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305973751-e1795274065983.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:16:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/court-pauses-army-iowa-lead-azide-detonation-permit/</guid></item><item><title>只有 18% 的 Z 世代员工希望培养人工智能技能。沃顿商学院教授表示，使用人工智能对他们来说风险更大</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/gen-z-workers-ai-skills-seramount-survey/</link><description>Sermount 对 1,800 多名美国白领进行的一项调查发现，Z 世代远不如年长的同事那么渴望培养人工智能技能。研究表明，他们对人工智能耻辱的恐惧并非没有根据。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2293950077-e1795273653284.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:11:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/gen-z-workers-ai-skills-seramount-survey/</guid></item><item><title>高盛承认“人工智能放松”已经演变成更危险的事情，并且正在观察 3 个触底迹象</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/goldman-sachs-sp-500-correction-ai-unwind-bottom-three-conditions-hedge-funds-positioning/</link><description>对冲基金已经削减了人工智能押注，但高盛表示，即使指数出现调整，共同基金、ETF和期货交易商仍大量投资。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305538532-e1795271671574.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:47:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/21/goldman-sachs-sp-500-correction-ai-unwind-bottom-three-conditions-hedge-funds-positioning/</guid></item><item><title>Goodwill首席执行官表示，招聘经理正在背着老板寻找拥有大学学位而不是技能的员工</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/goodwill-ceo-hiring-managers-going-behind-bosses-backs-looking-for-workers-with-college-degrees/</link><description>Goodwill 的首席执行官警告说，招聘经理正在悄然忽视技能优先的招聘，数百万没有学位的 Z 世代工人正在被失业。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2236920720-e1793809167835.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:26:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/goodwill-ceo-hiring-managers-going-behind-bosses-backs-looking-for-workers-with-college-degrees/</guid></item></channel></rss>